    "long_instructions": "###What does the page remember?\r\n\r\nTo make a page track something, tell the AI what to remember and how to show it.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Add a few habits, then change the display to Count, Bar or Recent.\r\n2. Tap the How it was built button to see the prompts used.\r\n3. See the prompt used to remember and how to show it.\r\n\r\n**Reflect & Discuss:**\r\nWhat would you want your own page to remember and show?",
